<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8"/>
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
<title>💋 Ular Tangga — Truth or Dare</title>
<link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="data:image/png;base64,"/>
<meta http-equiv="Content-Security-Policy" content="default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' data:; font-src 'self'; connect-src 'self'; frame-ancestors 'none'; base-uri 'self'; object-src 'none';">
<style>
*, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
input, textarea { -webkit-user-select: text; user-select: text; }


/* ── SCREEN TRANSITIONS ── */
#name-screen {
  animation: none;
}
#name-screen.screen-enter {
  animation: screenEnter 0.5s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1) forwards;
}
#name-screen.screen-exit {
  animation: screenExit 0.35s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 1, 1) forwards;
}
.game-wrap {
  animation: none;
}
.game-wrap.screen-enter {
  animation: screenEnter 0.5s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1) forwards;
}
.game-wrap.screen-exit {
  animation: screenExit 0.35s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 1, 1) forwards;
}
@keyframes screenEnter {
  0%   { opacity: 0; transform: scale(0.96) translateY(18px); }
  100% { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1) translateY(0); }
}
@keyframes screenExit {
  0%   { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1) translateY(0); }
  100% { opacity: 0; transform: scale(0.96) translateY(-18px); }
}

/* ── CUSTOM SCROLLBAR ── */
::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 4px; height: 4px; }
::-webkit-scrollbar-track { background: transparent; }
::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: rgba(244,63,94,0.3); border-radius: 99px; }
::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover { background: rgba(244,63,94,0.6); }
* { scrollbar-width: thin; scrollbar-color: rgba(244,63,94,0.3) transparent; }


  :root {
    --p0:    #f472b6;
    --p1:    #fb923c;
    --bg:    #0f0810;
    --bg2:   #1a0f18;
    --card:  rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
    --border:rgba(255,255,255,0.09);
    --rose:  #f43f5e;
    --gold:  #fcd34d;
    --font-ui:  system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;
    --font-display: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;
  }

  body {
    font-family: var(--font-ui);
    background: var(--bg);
    color: white;
    min-height: 100vh;
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center;
    padding: 12px 8px 28px;
    overflow-x: hidden;
    background-image:
      radial-gradient(ellipse at 20% 0%, rgba(244,63,94,0.12) 0%, transparent 50%),
      radial-gradient(ellipse at 80% 100%, rgba(251,146,60,0.10) 0%, transparent 50%);
  }

  .hearts-bg { position: fixed; inset: 0; pointer-events: none; z-index: 0; overflow: hidden; }
  .heart-float {
    position: absolute; bottom: -20px;
    font-size: 14px; opacity: 0;
    animation: floatUp linear infinite;
  }

  h1 {
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
    font-size: clamp(18px, 4.5vw, 30px); font-weight: 900;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, #f472b6, #fb7185, #fcd34d, #f472b6);
    background-size: 300%;
    -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    animation: gradientShift 5s linear infinite;
    text-align: center; margin-bottom: 4px;
    position: relative; z-index: 1;
  }
  .subtitle {
    font-size: 11px; color: rgba(244,63,94,0.6);
    letter-spacing: 3px; text-transform: uppercase;
    text-align: center; margin-bottom: 12px;
    position: relative; z-index: 1;
  }

  /* ── NAME SCREEN ── */
  #name-screen {
    position: fixed; inset: 0;
    background: var(--bg);
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    z-index: 500; padding: 20px;
    background-image:
      radial-gradient(ellipse at 30% 20%, rgba(244,63,94,0.18) 0%, transparent 50%),
      radial-gradient(ellipse at 70% 80%, rgba(251,146,60,0.12) 0%, transparent 50%);
    overflow-y: auto;
  }
  #name-screen h2 {
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
    font-size: clamp(22px, 5vw, 36px);
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, #f472b6, #fcd34d);
    -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    margin-bottom: 6px; text-align: center;
  }
  /* ── COLOR PICKER ── */
  .color-picker-row {
    display: flex; gap: 8px; align-items: center;
    margin-top: 4px; flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .color-swatch {
    width: 24px; height: 24px; border-radius: 50%; cursor: pointer;
    border: 2px solid transparent; transition: all 0.2s;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .color-swatch.selected {
    border-color: white;
    transform: scale(1.25);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px rgba(255,255,255,0.4);
  }
  .name-input-group {
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; flex: 1; min-width: 140px;
  }
  .name-input-group label {
    font-size: 11px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5); font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px; padding-left: 2px;
  }

  .name-fields {
    display: flex; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center;
    margin-bottom: 20px; width: 100%; max-width: 440px;
  }
  .name-field {
    flex: 1; min-width: 160px;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
    border: 1.5px solid rgba(244,63,94,0.3);
    border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;
    color: white; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700;
    text-align: center; outline: none;
    font-family: 'Nunito', sans-serif; transition: border-color .2s;
  }
  .name-field:focus { border-color: var(--rose); }
  .name-field::placeholder { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.3); font-weight: 600; }
  .btn-start {
    padding: 16px 48px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f43f5e, #fb923c);
    border: none; border-radius: 50px;
    color: white; font-weight: 900; font-size: 16px;
    cursor: pointer; font-family: 'Nunito', sans-serif;
    box-shadow: 0 6px 28px rgba(244,63,94,0.45);
    transition: all .2s; letter-spacing: .5px;
  }
  .btn-start:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: 0 10px 36px rgba(244,63,94,0.55); }

  /* ── PLAYER CARDS ── */
  .player-cards {
    display: flex; gap: 8px; width: 100%; max-width: 660px;
    margin-bottom: 10px; justify-content: center;
    position: relative; z-index: 1;
  }
  .player-card {
    flex: 1; max-width: 200px;
    padding: 10px 12px; border-radius: 12px;
    border: 2px solid var(--border);
    background: var(--card); transition: all .3s;
  }
  .player-card.active-0 { border-color: var(--p0); background: rgba(244,114,182,0.12); box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(244,114,182,0.25); }
  .player-card.active-1 { border-color: var(--p1); background: rgba(251,146,60,0.12);  box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(251,146,60,0.25); }
  .pcard-name  { font-weight: 800; font-size: 13px; }
  .pcard-pos   { font-size: 20px; font-weight: 900; margin-top: 2px; }
  .pcard-turn  { font-size: 11px; opacity: .7; animation: pulse 1.5s infinite; }

  /* ── LAYOUT ── */
  .game-layout {
    display: flex; gap: 12px; align-items: flex-start;
    width: 100%; max-width: 760px;
    justify-content: center; flex-wrap: nowrap;
    position: relative; z-index: 1;
  }

  /* ── BOARD ── */
  .board-wrap {
    position: relative;
    width: min(480px, calc(100vw - 160px));
    height: min(480px, calc(100vw - 160px));
    min-width: 220px; min-height: 220px;
    flex: 0 0 auto; border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.6), 0 0 0 1px rgba(244,63,94,0.15);
  }
  #board {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(10, 1fr);
    grid-template-rows: repeat(10, 1fr);
    width: 100%; height: 100%;
    border: 2px solid rgba(244,63,94,0.2);
    border-radius: 10px;
  }
  #board-overlay {
    position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0;
    width: 100%; height: 100%;
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .cell {
    position: relative;
    display: flex; flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid rgba(200,100,130,0.15);
  }
  .cell-even   { background: #2a0f1e; }
  .cell-odd    { background: #1f0a17; }
  .cell-snake  { background: #3d0a1a; border: 1.5px solid rgba(244,63,94,0.4) !important; }
  .cell-ladder { background: #1a1a0a; border: 1.5px solid rgba(252,211,77,0.4) !important; }
  .cell-duo    { background: #0f1a2e !important; border: 1.5px solid rgba(99,202,255,0.45) !important; }
  .cell-joker  { background: #1a1a06 !important; border: 1.5px solid rgba(252,211,77,0.55) !important; }
  .cell-wild   { background: #1a0a20 !important; border: 1.5px solid rgba(167,139,250,0.55) !important; }

  .cell-num {
    position: absolute; top: 1px; left: 2px;
    font-size: clamp(4px, .55vw, 6.5px);
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.25); font-weight: 800; line-height: 1;
    z-index: 2;
  }
  .cell-icons {
    display: flex; gap: 1px; flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center; line-height: 1;
    font-size: clamp(9px, 1.4vw, 16px);
  }

  /* ── CELL BADGE — big, centered, clear ── */
  .cell-tod {
    position: absolute;
    top: 50%; left: 50%;
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
    font-weight: 900; line-height: 1;
    border-radius: 4px;
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    pointer-events: none; z-index: 3;
    /* Size scales with board cell */
    width:  clamp(12px, 1.85vw, 22px);
    height: clamp(10px, 1.55vw, 18px);
    font-size: clamp(7px, 1.1vw, 13px);
    letter-spacing: 0;
  }
  .tod-t {
    color: #fff;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #6366f1, #4f46e5);
    box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(99,102,241,0.6);
  }
  .tod-d {
    color: #fff;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f43f5e, #e11d48);
    box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(244,63,94,0.6);
  }
  .tod-duo {
    color: #fff;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0ea5e9, #0284c7);
    box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(14,165,233,0.6);
    width: clamp(14px, 2vw, 24px);
    font-size: clamp(8px, 1.2vw, 14px);
  }
  .tod-joker {
    color: #1a1a00;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fcd34d, #f59e0b);
    box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(252,211,77,0.7);
    font-size: clamp(7px, 1.05vw, 12px);
  }
  .tod-wild {
    color: #fff;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #a855f7, #7c3aed);
    box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(168,85,247,0.6);
    font-size: clamp(7px, 1.05vw, 12px);
  }

  /* On mobile make badges a bit larger relative to screen */
  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .cell-tod {
      width:  clamp(14px, 4.2vw, 24px);
      height: clamp(11px, 3.4vw, 20px);
      font-size: clamp(8px, 2.6vw, 14px);
      border-radius: 3px;
    }
    .cell-num { font-size: clamp(4px, 1.1vw, 6px); }
  }

  /* ── PION LAYER ── */
  #pion-layer {
    position: absolute; inset: 0;
    pointer-events: none; z-index: 10;
  }
  .pion {
    position: absolute;
    width: 11%; height: 11%;
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    transition: left 0.22s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1),
                top  0.22s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1),
                transform 0.22s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1);
    will-change: left, top, transform;
    z-index: 20; transform: scale(1);
    transform-origin: center bottom;
    backface-visibility: hidden;
    -webkit-backface-visibility: hidden;
  }
  .pion img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: contain; }
  .pion svg { width: 100%; height: 100%; overflow: visible; }

  @keyframes cellPulse {
    0%   { filter: brightness(1) saturate(1); transform: scale(1); }
    40%  { filter: brightness(2.2) saturate(1.5); transform: scale(1.08); }
    100% { filter: brightness(1) saturate(1); transform: scale(1); }
  }
  .cell-pulse { animation: cellPulse 0.32s cubic-bezier(0.4,0,0.2,1); }

  /* ── SIDE PANEL ── */
  .side-panel {
    display: flex; flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center; gap: 8px;
    min-width: 130px; flex: 0 0 auto;
  }
  #dice-wrap {
    width: 68px; height: 68px; cursor: pointer;
    filter: drop-shadow(0 4px 12px rgba(244,63,94,0.4));
    transition: transform .15s;
  }
  #dice-wrap:hover { transform: scale(1.06); }
  #dice-wrap.rolling { animation: diceRoll 0.1s cubic-bezier(0.4,0,0.6,1) infinite alternate; }
  .btn-roll {
    width: 100%; padding: 11px 0;
    border: none; border-radius: 50px;
    color: white; font-weight: 900; font-size: 13.5px;
    cursor: pointer; transition: all .2s;
    font-family: 'Nunito', sans-serif;
  }
  .btn-roll:disabled { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.08) !important; cursor: not-allowed; opacity: .5; }

  .legend {
    background: var(--card); border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 10px; padding: 10px;
    font-size: 11px; line-height: 2; color: #bbb; width: 100%;
  }

  /* ── JOKER TOKENS ── */
  .joker-area { display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 8px; margin-top: 2px; }

  /* ── GAME DURATION TIMER ── */
  .game-duration {
    display: none;
    align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 6px;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.09);
    border-radius: 12px; padding: 5px 10px;
    font-family: 'Nunito', sans-serif;
    font-size: 12px; font-weight: 800;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.6);
    width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box;
    transition: all 0.4s;
  }
  .game-duration.active {
    display: flex;
    border-color: rgba(244,114,182,0.3);
    background: rgba(244,114,182,0.07);
    color: #f9a8d4;
  }
  .game-duration.done {
    border-color: rgba(252,211,77,0.4);
    background: rgba(252,211,77,0.08);
    color: #fcd34d;
  }
  .duration-clock { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: 1px; color: inherit; }

  /* ── MUSIC BUTTON ── */
  .btn-music-wrap {
    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;
    padding: 7px 10px; border-radius: 20px; cursor: pointer;
    font-family: 'Nunito', sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 800;
    border: 1.5px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
    color: #888; transition: all 0.25s; flex-shrink: 0;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .btn-music-wrap.on {
    background: rgba(244,114,182,0.15);
    border-color: rgba(244,114,182,0.5);
    color: #f472b6;
    box-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(244,114,182,0.2);
  }
  .music-dot {
    width: 6px; height: 6px; border-radius: 50%;
    background: #888; transition: all 0.25s; flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .btn-music-wrap.on .music-dot {
    background: #f472b6;
    box-shadow: 0 0 6px #f472b6;
    animation: musicPulse 1s ease infinite;
  }
  @keyframes musicPulse { 0%,100%{transform:scale(1);opacity:1} 50%{transform:scale(1.5);opacity:0.7} }
  .joker-token {
    padding: 3px 10px; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 800;
    background: rgba(252,211,77,0.12); border: 1.5px solid rgba(252,211,77,0.4);
    color: #fcd34d; cursor: default; transition: all .2s;
    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 4px;
  }
  .joker-token.has { cursor: pointer; background: rgba(252,211,77,0.22); }
  .joker-token.has:hover { background: rgba(252,211,77,0.35); transform: scale(1.05); }
  .joker-token.empty { opacity: 0.35; }

  .game-log {
    background: var(--card); border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 10px; padding: 10px;
    font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.9;
    color: #999; width: 100%; max-height: 110px; overflow: hidden;
  }
  .log-entry:first-child { color: #eee; }

  .btn-reset {
    width: 100%; padding: 8px 0;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 20px; color: #888;
    cursor: pointer; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700;
    transition: all .2s; font-family: 'Nunito', sans-serif;
  }
  .btn-reset:hover { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1); color: white; }

  /* ── TOD MODAL ── */
  #tod-overlay {
    display: none; position: fixed; inset: 0;
    background: rgba(0,0,0,0.0);
    align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    z-index: 100; padding: 16px;
    transition: background 0.35s ease;
  }
  #tod-overlay.show {
    display: flex;
    background: rgba(0,0,0,0.88);
    animation: overlayFadeIn 0.3s ease forwards;
  }
  @keyframes overlayFadeIn { from{background:rgba(0,0,0,0)} to{background:rgba(0,0,0,0.88)} }
  /* ── CARD FLIP ── */
  .tod-card-flipper {
    max-width: 460px; width: 100%;
    perspective: 1000px;
  }
  .tod-card-inner {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%; 
    transform-style: preserve-3d;
    transition: transform 0.55s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
  }
  .tod-card-inner.flipping {
    animation: cardFlipIn 0.55s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1) forwards;
  }
  @keyframes cardFlipIn {
    0%   { transform: rotateY(-90deg) scale(0.95); opacity: 0.3; }
    50%  { opacity: 1; }
    100% { transform: rotateY(0deg) scale(1); opacity: 1; }
  }
  .tod-card {
    background: linear-gradient(160deg, #1a0f18, #2a0f1e);
    border: 2px solid rgba(244,63,94,0.5);
    border-radius: 24px; padding: 24px 22px;
    width: 100%;
    box-shadow: 0 0 60px rgba(244,63,94,0.2), 0 24px 48px rgba(0,0,0,0.6);
    backface-visibility: hidden;
  }
  /* Content flip — just body animates when challenge changes */
  .tod-body-wrap {
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .tod-body-wrap.content-flip {
    animation: contentFlip 0.45s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
  }
  @keyframes contentFlip {
    0%   { transform: rotateX(-90deg) translateY(-20px); opacity: 0; }
    60%  { opacity: 1; }
    100% { transform: rotateX(0deg) translateY(0); opacity: 1; }
  }
  .tod-header { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; margin-bottom: 16px; }
  .tod-badge { border-radius: 20px; padding: 5px 16px; font-weight: 900; font-size: 13px; }

  /* Level bar */
  .level-bar { display: flex; gap: 4px; justify-content: center; margin-bottom: 6px; }
  .level-pip { height: 4px; border-radius: 2px; flex: 1; max-width: 40px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.12); transition: background 0.3s; }
  .level-pip.active-mild   { background: #f472b6; }
  .level-pip.active-medium { background: #fb923c; }
  .level-pip.active-hot    { background: #ef4444; box-shadow: 0 0 6px #ef444488; }
  .level-label { text-align: center; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .level-mild   { color: #f9a8d4; }
  .level-medium { color: #fdba74; }
  .level-hot    { color: #fca5a5; text-shadow: 0 0 8px #ef4444; }

  /* ── COUNTDOWN TIMER ── */
  #tod-timer {
    display: none; justify-content: center; align-items: center;
    gap: 10px; margin: 0 auto 10px;
  }
  #tod-timer.visible { display: flex; }
  #tod-timer svg { overflow: visible; }
  #timer-ring {
    transition: stroke-dashoffset 1s linear, stroke 0.5s ease;
    stroke-dasharray: 163.4;
    stroke-dashoffset: 0;
    stroke-linecap: round;
    transform-origin: center;
    transform: rotate(-90deg);
  }
  .timer-label {
    font-size: 11px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 1px;
    text-transform: uppercase; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5);
    line-height: 1.3; text-align: left;
  }
  .timer-label span { display: block; font-size: 9px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.3); font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0; }
  @keyframes timerUrgent { 0%,100%{opacity:1; transform:scale(1)} 50%{opacity:0.6; transform:scale(0.94)} }
  .timer-urgent #timer-ring { animation: timerUrgent 0.5s ease infinite; }
  .timer-urgent #timer-text { fill: #ef4444 !important; }

  .tod-type-badge { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 12px; }
  .tod-type-pill {
    display: inline-block; padding: 4px 18px;
    border-radius: 20px; font-weight: 900; font-size: 12px;
    letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .pill-truth { background: rgba(99,102,241,0.25); border: 1.5px solid #6366f1; color: #a5b4fc; }
  .pill-dare  { background: rgba(244,63,94,0.2);   border: 1.5px solid #f43f5e; color: #fda4af; }
  .pill-duo   { background: rgba(6,182,212,0.2);   border: 1.5px solid #06b6d4; color: #67e8f9; }
  .pill-wild  { background: rgba(139,92,246,0.2);  border: 1.5px solid #8b5cf6; color: #c4b5fd; }

  .tod-challenge {
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
    font-size: 17px; color: white;
    text-align: center; line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 20px; padding: 0 4px;
    min-height: 60px;
  }
  .tod-action-btns { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 10px; }
  .btn-done, .btn-skip {
    padding: 13px 12px; border: none; border-radius: 12px;
    color: white; font-family: 'Nunito', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 800; font-size: 14px; cursor: pointer; transition: all .2s;
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 6px;
  }
  .btn-done { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #10b981, #059669); box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(16,185,129,0.3); }
  .btn-done:hover { transform: translateY(-1px); }
  .btn-skip { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.07); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12); color: #999; }
  .btn-skip:hover { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.12); color: #ccc; }
  .tod-rule { margin-top: 10px; text-align: center; font-size: 11px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.35); }

  .btn-joker {
    display: none; padding: 10px; border: 1.5px solid rgba(252,211,77,0.5);
    border-radius: 12px; background: rgba(252,211,77,0.1);
    color: #fcd34d; font-family: 'Nunito',sans-serif; font-weight: 800;
    font-size: 13px; cursor: pointer; transition: all .2s; width: 100%;
    margin-top: 8px;
  }
  .btn-joker.visible { display: block; }
  .btn-joker:hover { background: rgba(252,211,77,0.22); }

  .skip-warning {
    text-align: center; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 800;
    color: #fca5a5; margin-top: 6px; display: none;
  }
  .skip-warning.show { display: block; }

  /* ── WINNER ── */
  #winner-overlay {
    display: none; position: fixed; inset: 0;
    background: rgba(0,0,0,0.92);
    align-items: flex-start; justify-content: center;
    z-index: 200; overflow-y: auto; overflow-x: hidden;
    -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;
    padding: 24px 16px 60px;
    scroll-behavior: smooth;
  }
  #winner-overlay.show { display: flex; }
  #winner-overlay .winner-card { margin: auto; flex-shrink: 0; }
  .winner-card {
    background: linear-gradient(160deg, #1a0f18, #2a0f1e);
    border: 3px solid var(--rose);
    border-radius: 28px; padding: 32px 28px; text-align: center;
    animation: bounceIn .5s ease;
    box-shadow: 0 0 100px rgba(244,63,94,0.35);
    max-width: 440px; width: 100%;
    margin: auto;
  }
  .winner-btn {
    margin-top: 20px; padding: 14px 40px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f43f5e, #fb923c);
    border: none; border-radius: 50px; color: white;
    font-weight: 900; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;
    font-family: 'Nunito', sans-serif;
    box-shadow: 0 6px 28px rgba(244,63,94,0.45); transition: all .2s;
  }
  .winner-btn:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); }

  /* ── ANIMATIONS ── */
  @keyframes gradientShift { 0%,100%{background-position:0%} 50%{background-position:100%} }
  @keyframes pulse         { 0%,100%{opacity:1} 50%{opacity:.5} }
  @keyframes slideUp       { from{transform:translateY(32px);opacity:0} to{transform:translateY(0);opacity:1} }
  @keyframes bounceIn      { 0%{transform:scale(.2);opacity:0} 55%{transform:scale(1.15)} 75%{transform:scale(0.95)} 100%{transform:scale(1);opacity:1} }
  @keyframes diceRoll      { 0%{transform:rotate(-12deg) scale(1.08)} 50%{transform:rotate(0deg) scale(0.92)} 100%{transform:rotate(12deg) scale(1.08)} }
  @keyframes floatUp       { 0%{transform:translateY(0) rotate(0deg);opacity:.7} 100%{transform:translateY(-100vh) rotate(360deg);opacity:0} }
  @keyframes heartBeat     { 0%,100%{transform:scale(1)} 50%{transform:scale(1.1)} }
  @keyframes jokerPop      { 0%{transform:scale(0.5) rotate(-15deg);opacity:0} 60%{transform:scale(1.3) rotate(8deg)} 100%{transform:scale(1) rotate(0deg);opacity:1} }
  @keyframes heatPulse     { 0%,100%{opacity:0.6} 50%{opacity:1} }
  @keyframes statCount     { from{transform:scale(1.4);color:#f43f5e} to{transform:scale(1)} }
  @keyframes pionLand      { 0%{transform:scale(1.4) translateY(-8px)} 60%{transform:scale(0.88) translateY(3px)} 80%{transform:scale(1.08)} 100%{transform:scale(1)} }
  @keyframes pionJump      { 0%,100%{transform:scale(1) translateY(0)} 50%{transform:scale(1.3) translateY(-12px)} }
  @keyframes snakeFall     { 0%{transform:scale(1) rotate(0deg)} 30%{transform:scale(1.2) rotate(-15deg) translateY(-6px)} 60%{transform:scale(0.8) rotate(20deg) translateY(4px)} 100%{transform:scale(1) rotate(0deg)} }
  @keyframes ladderRise    { 0%{transform:scale(1) translateY(0)} 20%{transform:scale(1.35) translateY(-10px)} 50%{transform:scale(1.5) translateY(-16px)} 80%{transform:scale(1.2) translateY(-6px)} 100%{transform:scale(1) translateY(0)} }
  @keyframes modalIn       { from{transform:translateY(20px) scale(0.97);opacity:0} to{transform:translateY(0) scale(1);opacity:1} }

  /* ── HEAT OVERLAY ── */
  #heat-overlay {
    position: fixed; inset: 0; pointer-events: none; z-index: 0;
    transition: opacity 1.5s ease; opacity: 0;
    background: radial-gradient(ellipse at center, transparent 30%, rgba(239,68,68,0.18) 100%);
  }
  #heat-overlay.heat-1 { opacity: 0.4; }
  #heat-overlay.heat-2 { opacity: 0.7; animation: heatPulse 3s ease infinite; }
  #heat-overlay.heat-3 { opacity: 1;   animation: heatPulse 1.8s ease infinite;
    background: radial-gradient(ellipse at center, transparent 20%, rgba(239,68,68,0.35) 100%);
  }

  .heat-badge {
    display: inline-block; font-size: 9px; font-weight: 900;
    padding: 1px 5px; border-radius: 8px; margin-left: 4px;
    vertical-align: middle; letter-spacing: 1px; transition: all 0.5s;
  }
  .heat-0 { display: none; }
  .heat-1 { background: rgba(251,146,60,0.25); color: #fb923c; border: 1px solid rgba(251,146,60,0.4); }
  .heat-2 { background: rgba(239,68,68,0.25);  color: #ef4444; border: 1px solid rgba(239,68,68,0.5); }
  .heat-3 { background: rgba(239,68,68,0.4);   color: #fff;    border: 1px solid #ef4444;
             box-shadow: 0 0 8px #ef444488; animation: heatPulse 1.5s infinite; }

  /* ── STATS ── */
  #stats-overlay {
    display: none; position: fixed; inset: 0;
    background: rgba(0,0,0,0.88);
    align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    z-index: 150; padding: 16px;
  }
  #stats-overlay.show { display: flex; }
  .stats-card {
    background: linear-gradient(160deg, #1a0f18, #22101c);
    border: 2px solid rgba(244,63,94,0.4);
    border-radius: 24px; padding: 28px 24px;
    max-width: 480px; width: 100%;
    animation: slideUp .3s ease;
    box-shadow: 0 0 60px rgba(244,63,94,0.2);
    max-height: 90vh; overflow-y: auto;
  }
  .stats-title {
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
    font-size: 20px; font-weight: 900; text-align: center;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg,#f472b6,#fcd34d);
    -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .stats-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 10px; margin-bottom: 18px; }
  .stat-block {
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
    border-radius: 14px; padding: 14px 12px; text-align: center;
  }
  .stat-num { font-size: 32px; font-weight: 900; line-height: 1; animation: statCount 0.3s ease; }
  .stat-label { font-size: 11px; color: #888; margin-top: 4px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px; font-weight: 700; }
  .stat-bar-wrap { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.06); border-radius: 8px; margin-bottom: 10px; overflow: hidden; }
  .stat-bar-label { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; padding: 8px 12px 4px; color: #ccc; }
  .stat-bar { height: 6px; border-radius: 0 0 8px 8px; transition: width 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.34,1.56,0.64,1); }
  .stats-section-title {
    font-size: 11px; font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: 2px;
    text-transform: uppercase; color: rgba(244,63,94,0.7);
    margin: 14px 0 8px; text-align: center;
  }
  .stat-achievement {
    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07);
    border-radius: 10px; padding: 8px 12px; margin-bottom: 6px;
    font-size: 12px; color: #bbb;
  }
  .stat-achievement .ach-icon { font-size: 18px; flex-shrink: 0; }
  .stat-achievement .ach-name { font-weight: 800; color: white; }
  .btn-close-stats {
    width: 100%; padding: 13px; border: none; border-radius: 12px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg,#f43f5e,#fb923c);
    color: white; font-family: 'Nunito',sans-serif;
    font-weight: 900; font-size: 14px; cursor: pointer;
    margin-top: 14px; transition: all .2s;
  }
  .btn-close-stats:hover { transform: translateY(-1px); }
  .btn-stats {
    width: 100%; padding: 8px 0;
    background: rgba(244,63,94,0.08);
    border: 1px solid rgba(244,63,94,0.25);
    border-radius: 20px; color: #f472b6;
    cursor: pointer; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700;
    transition: all .2s; font-family: 'Nunito', sans-serif;
  }
  .btn-stats:hover { background: rgba(244,63,94,0.18); }

  /* ── MOOD SELECTOR ── */
  .mood-selector {
    display: flex; gap: 8px; justify-content: center;
    margin-bottom: 20px; flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .mood-btn {
    padding: 10px 16px; border-radius: 50px; cursor: pointer;
    font-family: 'Nunito', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 13px;
    border: 2px solid transparent; transition: all .25s;
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 3px;
    min-width: 88px;
  }
  .mood-btn .mood-emoji { font-size: 22px; line-height: 1; }
  .mood-btn .mood-name  { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: .5px; }
  .mood-btn .mood-desc  { font-size: 10px; opacity: .7; font-weight: 600; }
  .mood-btn.romantis { background: rgba(244,114,182,0.12); border-color: rgba(244,114,182,0.35); color: #f9a8d4; }
  .mood-btn.playful  { background: rgba(251,146,60,0.12);  border-color: rgba(251,146,60,0.35);  color: #fdba74; }
  .mood-btn.liar     { background: rgba(239,68,68,0.12);   border-color: rgba(239,68,68,0.35);   color: #fca5a5; }
  .mood-btn.romantis.active { background: rgba(244,114,182,0.28); border-color: #f472b6; color: white; box-shadow: 0 0 18px rgba(244,114,182,0.4); transform: scale(1.06); }
  .mood-btn.playful.active  { background: rgba(251,146,60,0.28);  border-color: #fb923c; color: white; box-shadow: 0 0 18px rgba(251,146,60,0.4);  transform: scale(1.06); }
  .mood-btn.liar.active     { background: rgba(239,68,68,0.28);   border-color: #ef4444; color: white; box-shadow: 0 0 18px rgba(239,68,68,0.5);   transform: scale(1.06); }

  /* Mood badge in subtitle bar */
  #mood-badge-bar {
    font-size: 11px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5);
    text-align: center; margin-bottom: 10px;
    position: relative; z-index: 1;
    letter-spacing: 1px; transition: all 0.4s;
  }

  /* ── RECAP CARD OVERLAY ── */
  #recap-overlay {
    display: none; position: fixed; inset: 0;
    background: rgba(0,0,0,0.92);
    align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    z-index: 300; padding: 16px; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px;
  }
  #recap-overlay.show { display: flex; }
  #recap-canvas {
    border-radius: 20px;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 60px rgba(244,63,94,0.35);
    max-height: 72vh; width: auto;
    display: block;
  }
  .recap-actions {
    display: flex; gap: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center;
  }
  .btn-recap-dl {
    padding: 13px 28px; border: none; border-radius: 50px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f43f5e, #fb923c);
    color: white; font-family: 'Nunito', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 900; font-size: 14px; cursor: pointer;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(244,63,94,0.4); transition: all .2s;
  }
  .btn-recap-dl:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); }
  .btn-recap-close {
    padding: 13px 24px; border: 1.5px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2);
    border-radius: 50px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
    color: #aaa; font-family: 'Nunito', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 800; font-size: 14px; cursor: pointer; transition: all .2s;
  }
  /* ══════════════════════════════════════════════
     RESPONSIVE — MOBILE FIRST
     ══════════════════════════════════════════════ */

  /* ── Mobile portrait (≤ 600px) ─────────────── */
  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    body { padding: 8px 6px 24px; }

    h1 { font-size: 22px; margin-bottom: 2px; }
    .subtitle { font-size: 9px; letter-spacing: 2px; margin-bottom: 6px; }
    #mood-badge-bar { margin-bottom: 6px; }

    /* Player cards — compact horizontal */
    .player-cards {
      gap: 6px; margin-bottom: 8px;
    }
    .player-card {
      padding: 7px 9px; border-radius: 10px;
      max-width: none; flex: 1;
    }
    .pcard-name { font-size: 11px; }
    .pcard-pos  { font-size: 15px; }

    /* Game layout — board on top, side panel below */
    .game-layout {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 8px;
    }

    /* Board fills almost full width */
    .board-wrap {
      width: min(420px, calc(100vw - 12px));
      height: min(420px, calc(100vw - 12px));
      min-width: 0; min-height: 0;
    }

    /* Side panel — horizontal row layout */
    .side-panel {
      flex-direction: row;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: flex-start;
      width: 100%; min-width: 0;
      gap: 8px;
    }

    /* Dice smaller on mobile */
    #dice-wrap { width: 54px; height: 54px; }

    .btn-roll {
      width: auto; min-width: 100px;
      padding: 10px 16px; font-size: 13px;
    }

    /* Legend hidden on mobile — save space */
    .legend { display: none; }

    /* Log compact */
    .game-log {
      max-height: 70px; font-size: 10px;
      flex: 1; min-width: 160px;
    }

    /* Joker area inline */
    .joker-area { margin-top: 0; }

    /* Stats + mute row */
    .side-panel > div[style*="display:flex"] {
      width: auto;
    }
    .btn-stats { width: auto; padding: 8px 14px; font-size: 11px; }
    .btn-reset { width: auto; padding: 8px 14px; font-size: 11px; }

    /* TOD modal — full screen on mobile */
    #tod-overlay { padding: 8px; align-items: flex-end; }
    .tod-card {
      border-radius: 20px 20px 0 0;
      padding: 18px 16px 24px;
      max-width: 100%;
    }
    .tod-challenge { font-size: 14px; min-height: 50px; margin-bottom: 14px; }
    .btn-done, .btn-skip { padding: 12px 8px; font-size: 13px; }

    /* Winner card */
    .winner-card { padding: 28px 20px; border-radius: 20px; }

    /* Stats card full width */
    .stats-card { padding: 20px 16px; border-radius: 20px; }

    /* Name screen */
    #name-screen { padding: 16px 12px; }
    #name-screen .rules-box { padding: 12px 14px; }
    #name-screen ol li { font-size: 11.5px; }
    .name-field { padding: 12px 14px; font-size: 14px; }
    .btn-start  { padding: 14px 36px; font-size: 15px; }
    .mood-btn   { min-width: 76px; padding: 8px 10px; }
    .mood-btn .mood-emoji { font-size: 18px; }
    .mood-btn .mood-name  { font-size: 10px; }

    /* Recap canvas fits screen */
    #recap-canvas { max-height: 65vh; }
    .btn-recap-dl, .btn-recap-close { padding: 11px 20px; font-size: 13px; }
  }

  /* ── Mobile landscape / small tablet (601–840px) ── */
  @media (min-width: 601px) and (max-width: 840px) {
    .board-wrap {
      width: min(400px, calc(100vw - 155px));
      height: min(400px, calc(100vw - 155px));
    }
    .side-panel { min-width: 120px; }
    .game-log   { max-height: 90px; }
    .legend     { font-size: 10px; line-height: 1.8; }
  }

  /* ── Laptop / desktop (≥ 841px) ─────────────── */
  @media (min-width: 841px) {
    .game-layout { flex-wrap: nowrap; }
    .side-panel  { min-width: 140px; }
    .board-wrap {
      width: min(500px, calc(100vw - 170px));
      height: min(500px, calc(100vw - 170px));
    }
  }

  /* ── Tall phones: ensure name screen scrollable ── */
  @media (max-height: 700px) and (max-width: 600px) {
    #name-screen {
      justify-content: flex-start;
      padding-top: 20px;
      padding-bottom: 20px;
    }
    #name-screen .rules-box { max-height: 160px; overflow-y: auto; }
  }

  /* ── KARTU BERANI ── */
  .cell-berani { background: #1a0d06 !important; border: 1.5px solid rgba(251,146,60,0.65) !important; }
  .tod-berani {
    color: #fff;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fb923c, #f43f5e);
    box-shadow: 0 1px 5px rgba(251,146,60,0.7);
    width:  clamp(14px, 2.1vw, 26px);
    height: clamp(11px, 1.7vw, 20px);
    font-size: clamp(8px, 1.25vw, 15px);
  }
  .pill-berani {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(251,146,60,0.3), rgba(244,63,94,0.3));
    border: 1.5px solid #fb923c; color: #fed7aa;
  }
  @media (max-width:600px) { .tod-berani { width:clamp(16px,4.5vw,28px);height:clamp(12px,3.6vw,22px);font-size:clamp(9px,2.8vw,15px); } }

  /* ── CONFETTI CANVAS ── */
  #confetti-canvas { position:fixed;inset:0;pointer-events:none;z-index:9999;width:100%;height:100%; }

  /* ── STREAK BADGE ── */
  .streak-badge {
    display: none; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 900;
    padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 20px;
    background: rgba(251,146,60,0.18); border: 1.5px solid rgba(251,146,60,0.5);
    color: #fdba74;
    transition: all 0.3s;
  }
  .streak-badge.show { display:inline-block; animation: streakPop 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.34,1.56,0.64,1); }
  .streak-badge.hot  { background:rgba(244,63,94,0.28);border-color:#f43f5e;color:#fda4af;
                       box-shadow:0 0 10px rgba(244,63,94,0.4); animation: streakHot 0.8s ease infinite alternate; }
  .streak-badge.mega { background:rgba(252,211,77,0.3);border-color:#fcd34d;color:#fcd34d;
                       box-shadow:0 0 14px rgba(252,211,77,0.6); animation: streakHot 0.5s ease infinite alternate; }
  @keyframes streakPop { 0%{transform:scale(0.4);opacity:0} 100%{transform:scale(1);opacity:1} }
  @keyframes streakHot { 0%{transform:scale(1)} 100%{transform:scale(1.15)} }

  /* ── STREAK TOAST ── */
  #streak-toast {
    position: fixed; top: 18px; left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(-80px);
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f43f5e, #fb923c);
    color: white; font-weight: 900; font-size: 14px;
    padding: 10px 26px; border-radius: 50px;
    box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(244,63,94,0.5);
    z-index: 9998; pointer-events: none;
    transition: transform 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.34,1.56,0.64,1), opacity 0.35s;
    opacity: 0; white-space: nowrap;
  }
  #streak-toast.show { transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(0); opacity: 1; }

  /* ── CUSTOM TANTANGAN ── */
  .custom-section {
    width:100%;max-width:440px;
    background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);
    border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
    border-radius:16px;margin-bottom:20px;overflow:hidden;
  }
  .custom-toggle {
    width:100%;padding:13px 18px;background:none;border:none;cursor:pointer;
    display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;
    color:#c4b5fd;font-family:'Nunito',sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:13px;
    transition:background 0.2s;
  }
  .custom-toggle:hover { background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04); }
  .custom-toggle-arrow { transition:transform 0.3s;font-style:normal; }
  .custom-toggle-arrow.open { transform:rotate(180deg); }
  .custom-body { display:none;padding:0 16px 16px; }
  .custom-body.open { display:block; }
  .custom-tabs { display:flex;gap:6px;margin-bottom:12px; }
  .custom-tab {
    flex:1;padding:7px 0;border:none;border-radius:8px;
    font-family:'Nunito',sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:12px;
    cursor:pointer;transition:all .2s;letter-spacing:1px;
  }
  .custom-tab.truth-tab { background:rgba(99,102,241,0.15);color:#a5b4fc;border:1.5px solid rgba(99,102,241,0.3); }
  .custom-tab.truth-tab.active { background:rgba(99,102,241,0.35);border-color:#6366f1;color:#fff; }
  .custom-tab.dare-tab  { background:rgba(244,63,94,0.12);color:#fda4af;border:1.5px solid rgba(244,63,94,0.3); }
  .custom-tab.dare-tab.active  { background:rgba(244,63,94,0.3);border-color:#f43f5e;color:#fff; }
  .custom-input-row { display:flex;gap:6px;margin-bottom:10px; }
  .custom-input {
    flex:1;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.06);border:1.5px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
    border-radius:10px;padding:10px 12px;color:white;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;
    outline:none;font-family:'Nunito',sans-serif;transition:border-color .2s;
  }
  .custom-input:focus { border-color:#a855f7; }
  .custom-input::placeholder { color:rgba(255,255,255,0.25); }
  .btn-custom-add {
    padding:10px 14px;border:none;border-radius:10px;
    background:linear-gradient(135deg,#a855f7,#7c3aed);color:white;
    font-weight:900;font-size:18px;cursor:pointer;transition:all .2s;flex-shrink:0;
  }
  .btn-custom-add:hover { transform:scale(1.08); }
  .custom-list { display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:5px;max-height:140px;overflow-y:auto; }
  .custom-item {
    display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:6px;
    background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);border-radius:8px;
    padding:7px 10px;font-size:11.5px;color:#ddd;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07);
  }
  .custom-item-text { flex:1;line-height:1.45; }
  .btn-custom-del { background:none;border:none;color:rgba(255,100,100,0.5);cursor:pointer;font-size:14px;padding:0;flex-shrink:0;transition:color .2s; }
  .btn-custom-del:hover { color:#f87171; }
  .custom-empty { color:rgba(255,255,255,0.25);font-size:11px;text-align:center;padding:8px 0;font-style:italic; }
  .custom-count { font-size:10px;opacity:.6;font-weight:700;margin-left:4px; }

  /* ── PION PICKER ── */
  .pion-picker-row {
    display: flex; gap: 10px; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin-top: 6px;
  }
  .pion-option {
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 4px;
    cursor: pointer; padding: 6px 8px; border-radius: 14px;
    border: 2px solid transparent; transition: all 0.2s;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
  }
  .pion-option:hover { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.08); transform: scale(1.05); }
  .pion-option.selected-0 { border-color: var(--p0); background: rgba(244,114,182,0.12); }
  .pion-option.selected-1 { border-color: var(--p1); background: rgba(251,146,60,0.12); }
  .pion-option svg, .pion-option > div { pointer-events: none; }
  .pion-label { font-size: 10px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.45); font-weight: 700; text-align: center; }

</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="hearts-bg" id="hearts-bg"></div>
<div id="heat-overlay"></div>
<div id="streak-toast"></div>

<!-- ── 18+ CONSENT SCREEN ── -->
<div id="age-consent-screen">
  <div style="font-size:56px;margin-bottom:14px;animation:heartBeat 2s ease infinite">🔞</div>
  <h2 style="font-family:var(--font-display);margin-bottom:8px">Konten Dewasa (18+)</h2>
  <p style="color:#e2e8f0;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:20px;text-align:center">
    Game ini berisi tantangan Truth or Dare dewasa yang mungkin mencakup konten intim, remaja dewasa, dan tema seksual ringan. Hanya bagi pengguna berusia 18 tahun ke atas.
  </p>
  <div style="margin-bottom:22px">
    <label style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;cursor:pointer;font-size:13px;color:#e2e8f0;user-select:none">
      <input type="checkbox" id="age-confirm" style="accent-color:#f472b6;width:16px;height:16px"/>
      Saya berusia 18 tahun atau lebih dan setuju untuk bermain dengan pasangan saya.
    </label>
  </div>
  <div style="margin-bottom:22px">
    <label style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;cursor:pointer;font-size:13px;color:#e2e8f0;user-select:none">
      <input type="checkbox" id="consent-agree" style="accent-color:#f472b6;width:16px;height:16px"/>
      Saya memahami bahwa saya maupun pasangan saya boleh menolak setiap tantangan dan dapat berhenti kapan saja tanpa sanksi.
    </label>
  </div>
  <button id="btn-age-confirm" onclick="confirmAge()" disabled style="
    width:100%;padding:14px;border:none;border-radius:20px;background:rgba(244,63,94,0.2);border:1px solid rgba(244,63,94,0.35);
    color:#f9a8d4;font-weight:900;font-size:15px;cursor:not-allowed;font-family:var(--font-ui);opacity:0.6;transition:all .2s;
  ">Saya Setuju &amp; Mulai 💕</button>
</div>

<!-- ── NAME SCREEN ── -->
<div id="name-screen">
  <div style="font-size:52px;margin-bottom:12px;animation:heartBeat 2s ease infinite">💕</div>
  <h2>Ular Tangga</h2>
  <h2 style="font-size:clamp(14px,3vw,20px);margin-top:-4px">Truth or Dare</h2>
  <p style="margin-top:10px;color:#aaa;font-size:13px;margin-bottom:22px">Masukkan nama kalian untuk mulai 🔥</p>

  <button onclick="showRules()" style="
    background:rgba(244,63,94,0.1);border:1px solid rgba(244,63,94,0.3);
    border-radius:20px;padding:8px 20px;color:#f9a8d4;cursor:pointer;
    font-family:'Nunito',sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:13px;
    margin-bottom:18px;transition:all .2s;letter-spacing:.5px"
    onmouseover="this.style.background='rgba(244,63,94,0.2)'"
    onmouseout="this.style.background='rgba(244,63,94,0.1)'">
    📜 Lihat Peraturan Game
  </button>

    <div class="name-fields">
    <div class="name-input-group">
      <label>💋 Pemain 1</label>
      <input class="name-field" id="name0" placeholder="Nama kamu..." maxlength="20"/>
      <div style="font-size:11px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.5);font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px;margin-top:8px;padding-left:2px">Pilih Bidak</div>
      <div class="pion-picker-row" id="pions0"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="name-input-group">
      <label>🧡 Pemain 2</label>
      <input class="name-field" id="name1" placeholder="Nama dia..." maxlength="20"/>
      <div style="font-size:11px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.5);font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px;margin-top:8px;padding-left:2px">Pilih Bidak</div>
      <div class="pion-picker-row" id="pions1"></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-size:13px;color:#f472b6;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:12px;letter-spacing:1px;text-align:center">🎭 Pilih Vibe Malam Ini</div>
  <div class="mood-selector">
    <button class="mood-btn romantis active" id="mood-romantis" onclick="selectMood('romantis')">
      <span class="mood-emoji">💕</span>
      <span class="mood-name">ROMANTIC</span>
      <span class="mood-desc">Lembut & manis</span>
    </button>
    <button class="mood-btn playful" id="mood-playful" onclick="selectMood('playful')">
      <span class="mood-emoji">😜</span>
      <span class="mood-name">TEASING</span>
      <span class="mood-desc">Fun & seru</span>
    </button>
    <button class="mood-btn liar" id="mood-liar" onclick="selectMood('liar')">
      <span class="mood-emoji">🔥</span>
      <span class="mood-name">SPICY</span>
      <span class="mood-desc">No limits!</span>
    </button>
  </div>

  <button class="btn-start" onclick="startGame()">Mulai Sekarang 💕</button>

  <button onclick="showCustomOverlay()" style="
    background:rgba(168,85,247,0.1);border:1px solid rgba(168,85,247,0.3);
    border-radius:20px;padding:8px 20px;color:#c4b5fd;cursor:pointer;
    font-family:'Nunito',sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:13px;
    margin-bottom:18px;transition:all .2s;letter-spacing:.5px"
    onmouseover="this.style.background='rgba(168,85,247,0.2)'"
    onmouseout="this.style.background='rgba(168,85,247,0.1)'">
    ✏️ Tantangan Kustom <span id="custom-count-label" style="opacity:.6">(0)</span>
  </button>
</div>

<!-- ── GAME ── -->
<h1>💋 Truth or Dare</h1>
<div class="subtitle">for couples · 17+</div>
<div id="mood-badge-bar"></div>

<div class="player-cards">
  <div class="player-card" id="pcard-0">
    <div class="pcard-name" id="pname-0" style="color:var(--p0);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px">
      <span id="picon-0" style="display:inline-flex;width:20px;height:24px;flex-shrink:0"></span>
      <span id="pname-text-0">Pemain 1</span>
      <span class="heat-badge heat-0" id="heat-badge-0">🔥</span>
    </div>
    <div class="pcard-pos" id="ppos-0">Kotak 1</div>
    <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:3px;flex-wrap:wrap">
      <div class="pcard-turn" id="pturn-0" style="color:var(--p0)">← giliran</div>
      <div style="font-size:10px;color:#888" id="pstat-mini-0">✅0 ❌0</div>
      <span class="streak-badge" id="streak-0"></span>
      <button id="skip-tod-btn-0" onclick="useSkipTod(0)" style="display:none;align-items:center;gap:4px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f59e0b,#d97706);border:none;border-radius:10px;color:white;font-weight:900;font-size:10px;padding:3px 8px;cursor:pointer;font-family:'Nunito',sans-serif">🎟️ Skip TOD ×0</button>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="player-card" id="pcard-1">
    <div class="pcard-name" id="pname-1" style="color:var(--p1);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px">
      <span id="picon-1" style="display:inline-flex;width:20px;height:24px;flex-shrink:0"></span>
      <span id="pname-text-1">Pemain 2</span>
      <span class="heat-badge heat-0" id="heat-badge-1">🔥</span>
    </div>
    <div class="pcard-pos" id="ppos-1">Kotak 1</div>
    <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:3px;flex-wrap:wrap">
      <div class="pcard-turn" id="pturn-1" style="color:var(--p1);display:none">← giliran</div>
      <div style="font-size:10px;color:#888" id="pstat-mini-1">✅0 ❌0</div>
      <span class="streak-badge" id="streak-1"></span>
      <button id="skip-tod-btn-1" onclick="useSkipTod(1)" style="display:none;align-items:center;gap:4px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f59e0b,#d97706);border:none;border-radius:10px;color:white;font-weight:900;font-size:10px;padding:3px 8px;cursor:pointer;font-family:'Nunito',sans-serif">🎟️ Skip TOD ×0</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="game-layout">
  <div class="board-wrap">
    <div id="board"></div>
    <svg id="board-overlay" viewBox="0 0 100 100" preserveAspectRatio="none"></svg>
    <div id="pion-layer"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="side-panel">
    <svg id="dice-wrap" viewBox="0 0 100 100" onclick="rollDice()">
      <rect rx="14" width="100" height="100" fill="#2a0f1e"/>
      <text x="50" y="66" text-anchor="middle" font-size="44">🎲</text>
    </svg>
    <button class="btn-roll" id="btn-roll" onclick="rollDice()">🎲 Lempar!</button>
    <div class="legend">
      <div>🐍 Ular → turun</div>
      <div>🪜 Tangga → naik</div>
      <div>⚡ Kotak biru → berdua</div>
      <div>🃏 Kotak emas → joker</div>
      <div>🎯 Kotak ungu → wild</div>
    </div>
    <div class="joker-area">
      <div class="joker-token empty" id="joker-0" onclick="useJokerFromPanel(0)">🃏 0</div>
      <div class="joker-token empty" id="joker-1" onclick="useJokerFromPanel(1)">🃏 0</div>
    </div>

    <!-- ── DURASI PERMAINAN ── -->
    <div class="game-duration" id="game-duration">
      <span>⏱️</span>
      <span class="duration-clock" id="duration-display">00:00</span>
      <span style="font-size:10px;opacity:.7">durasi main</span>
    </div>

    <div class="game-log" id="game-log">
      <div class="log-entry">💕 Game dimulai!</div>
    </div>
    <div style="display:flex;gap:6px;width:100%">
      <button class="btn-stats" onclick="showStats()" style="flex:1">📊 Statistik</button>
      <button id="btn-music" onclick="toggleMusic()" title="Musik latar" class="btn-music-wrap">
        <span class="music-dot"></span>🎵
      </button>
      <button id="btn-mute" onclick="toggleMute()" title="Toggle suara" style="
        padding:8px 10px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
        border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.09);border-radius:20px;
        color:#aaa;cursor:pointer;font-size:14px;transition:all .2s;
        font-family:'Nunito',sans-serif;flex-shrink:0">🔊</button>
    </div>
    <button class="btn-reset" onclick="goToMoodScreen()">🚪 Ganti Mode</button>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ── STATS OVERLAY ── -->
<div id="stats-overlay">
  <div class="stats-card">
    <div class="stats-title">📊 Statistik Game</div>
    <div id="stats-body"></div>
    <button class="btn-close-stats" onclick="document.getElementById('stats-overlay').classList.remove('show')">Tutup</button>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ── TOD MODAL ── -->
<div id="tod-overlay">
  <div class="tod-card-flipper">
    <div class="tod-card-inner" id="tod-card-inner">
  <div class="tod-card" id="tod-card">
    <div class="tod-header">
      <div class="tod-badge" id="tod-badge"></div>
      <div style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.4);font-size:12px" id="tod-sq"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="level-bar">
      <div class="level-pip" id="lpip-0"></div>
      <div class="level-pip" id="lpip-1"></div>
      <div class="level-pip" id="lpip-2"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="level-label" id="level-label"></div>

    <!-- ⏱️ COUNTDOWN TIMER (dare only) -->
    <div id="tod-timer">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 60 60" width="52" height="52">
        <circle cx="30" cy="30" r="26" fill="none" stroke="rgba(255,255,255,0.08)" stroke-width="4"/>
        <circle id="timer-ring" cx="30" cy="30" r="26" fill="none" stroke="#10b981" stroke-width="4"
          style="stroke-dasharray:163.4;stroke-dashoffset:0;transform-origin:center;transform:rotate(-90deg);stroke-linecap:round;transition:stroke-dashoffset 1s linear,stroke 0.5s ease"/>
        <text id="timer-text" x="30" y="35" text-anchor="middle" fill="white"
          font-size="15" font-weight="900" font-family="Nunito,sans-serif">–</text>
      </svg>
      <div class="timer-label">
        <span id="timer-level-hint">⏱️ Timer siap</span>
        <div style="display:flex;gap:6px;margin-top:6px">
          <button id="btn-timer-start" onclick="manualStartTimer()"
            style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#10b981,#059669);border:none;border-radius:10px;
            color:white;font-weight:900;font-size:11px;padding:5px 10px;cursor:pointer;
            font-family:'Nunito',sans-serif;transition:all .2s">
            ▶ Mulai
          </button>
          <button id="btn-timer-skip" onclick="manualSkipTimer()"
            style="background:rgba(255,255,255,0.08);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.15);
            border-radius:10px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.5);font-weight:700;font-size:11px;
            padding:5px 10px;cursor:pointer;font-family:'Nunito',sans-serif;transition:all .2s">
            ✕
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="tod-body-wrap" id="tod-body-wrap"><div id="tod-body"></div></div>
    <button class="btn-joker" id="btn-joker" onclick="useJoker()">🃏 Joker: Skip Gratis + Imun Ular!</button>
    <div class="skip-warning" id="skip-warning">⚠️ Skip terakhir! (2/2)</div>
  </div>
    </div><!-- tod-card-inner -->
  </div><!-- tod-card-flipper -->
</div>

<!-- ── WINNER ── -->
<div id="winner-overlay">
  <div class="winner-card" style="max-width:440px">
    <div style="font-size:64px;margin-bottom:8px;animation:heartBeat 1s infinite">🏆</div>
    <div style="font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-size:13px;color:var(--rose);letter-spacing:4px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:10px">PEMENANG</div>
    <div style="font-size:28px;font-weight:900" id="winner-name"></div>
    <div style="color:#888;font-size:13px;margin-top:6px;margin-bottom:20px">Sampai di kotak 100! 💋</div>
    <div id="winner-stats-body" style="text-align:left"></div>
    <div style="display:flex;gap:10px;margin-top:20px;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center">
      <button class="winner-btn" style="margin-top:0" onclick="showRecap()">📸 Lihat Recap</button>
      <button class="winner-btn" style="margin-top:0" onclick="confirmReset()">🎮 Main Lagi</button>
      <button class="winner-btn" style="margin-top:0;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#a855f7,#6366f1);box-shadow:0 6px 28px rgba(168,85,247,0.45)" onclick="goToMoodScreen()">🎭 Ganti Mode</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ── RECAP CARD OVERLAY ── -->
<div id="recap-overlay">
  <canvas id="recap-canvas" width="360" height="640"></canvas>
  <div class="recap-actions">
    <button class="btn-recap-dl" onclick="downloadRecap()">⬇️ Simpan Gambar</button>
    <button class="btn-recap-close" onclick="document.getElementById('recap-overlay').classList.remove('show')">✕ Tutup</button>
  </div>
  <div style="font-size:11px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.3);text-align:center">Screenshot atau klik Simpan untuk download 💕</div>
</div>

<!-- ── RULES OVERLAY ── -->
<div id="rules-overlay" style="display:none;position:fixed;inset:0;background:rgba(0,0,0,0.88);z-index:600;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:16px;overflow-y:auto;-webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch;">
  <div style="background:linear-gradient(160deg,#1a0f18,#2a0f1e);border:2px solid rgba(244,63,94,0.4);border-radius:24px;padding:28px 24px;max-width:460px;width:100%;animation:modalIn .35s cubic-bezier(0.34,1.56,0.64,1);max-height:90vh;overflow-y:auto;">
    <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:18px">
      <div style="font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-size:16px;color:#f472b6;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1px">📜 Peraturan Game</div>
      <button onclick="hideRules()" style="background:none;border:none;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.4);font-size:22px;cursor:pointer;line-height:1;padding:0 4px">&times;</button>
    </div>
    <ol style="padding-left:18px;margin:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:9px;">
      <li style="color:#e2e8f0;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5">Lempar dadu secara bergantian — siapa duluan bebas pilih.</li>
      <li style="color:#e2e8f0;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5">Setiap kotak sudah punya label <span style="color:#a5b4fc;font-weight:800">T</span> atau <span style="color:#fda4af;font-weight:800">D</span> — tidak bisa pilih sendiri.</li>
      <li style="color:#e2e8f0;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5">🪜 Naik tangga = langsung lompat ke kotak atas.</li>
      <li style="color:#e2e8f0;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5">🐍 Kena ular = turun ke kotak bawah.</li>
      <li style="color:#e2e8f0;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5">Efek ular &amp; tangga berlaku <em style="color:#fcd34d">setelah</em> tantangan diselesaikan.</li>
      <li style="color:#e2e8f0;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5">✅ Selesaikan = tetap di kotak. ❌ Skip = mundur 3 kotak.</li>
      <li style="color:#e2e8f0;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5">Tidak boleh skip lebih dari 2 kali berturut-turut.</li>
      <li style="color:#e2e8f0;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5">⏱️ <strong style="color:#10b981">Dare punya timer</strong> — muncul otomatis sesuai durasi di tantangan. Tekan ▶ Mulai untuk memulai.</li>
      <li style="color:#e2e8f0;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5">Dadu 6 = giliran tambahan setelah tantangan selesai! 🎲</li>
      <li style="color:#e2e8f0;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5">⚡ Kotak biru = tantangan <strong style="color:#67e8f9">berdua</strong> — dilakukan bersama!</li>
      <li style="color:#e2e8f0;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5">🃏 Kotak emas = dapat <strong style="color:#fcd34d">Joker token</strong> — gunakan untuk skip gratis + imun ular!</li>
      <li style="color:#e2e8f0;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5">🎯 Kotak ungu = <strong style="color:#c4b5fd">Wild</strong> — bebas pilih Truth atau Dare!</li>
      <li style="color:#e2e8f0;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5">💪 Kotak oranye = <strong style="color:#fb923c">Kartu Berani</strong> — khusus mode 🔥 Spicy, tantangan extra intens, skip mundur <strong style="color:#fb923c">3 kotak</strong> (sama seperti mode lain). Di mode lain kotak ini jadi Dare biasa.</li>
